てみたいのでよろしくお願いします！", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@AroON_1106/works/6", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/a53b2c48/uploads/origins/b38c7235-a653-4603-9850-7d9f719c13e8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7224f2de5c026dfc3f4cf1e9e6846cc0", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/a53b2c48/uploads/origins/b38c7235-a653-4603-9850-7d9f719c13e8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7224f2de5c026dfc3f4cf1e9e6846cc0, https://si.imgix.net/a53b2c48/uploads/origins/b38c7235-a653-4603-9850-7d9f719c13e8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d2a5d11b366b914252cf3d560a747a12 2x, https://si.imgix.net/a53b2c48/uploads/origins/b38c7235-a653-4603-9850-7d9f719c13e8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9d2f138ca9d3e91cade13f3a3374db54 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "今度は喜多家でお泊まり会をする虹喜多はどうでしょうかね？", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@AroON_1106/works/5", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/5b844ce4/uploads/origins/05aa5285-519d-4e79-ae94-ad480b9f1f55?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a323bfc7147e8305048db1c8c2a9d3c7", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/5b844ce4/uploads/origins/05aa5285-519d-4e79-ae94-ad480b9f1f55?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a323bfc7147e8305048db1c8c2a9d3c7, https://si.imgix.net/5b844ce4/uploads/origins/05aa5285-519d-4e79-ae94-ad480b9f1f55?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ac09ff8831c893ab98c92afe91a3a01e 2x, https://si.imgix.net/5b844ce4/uploads/origins/05aa5285-519d-4e79-ae94-ad480b9f1f55?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e55b996739653fb9fbfaedefadb8bc16 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "この前の虹夏と喜多のお泊まり会(健全)の話をお願いしてもいいですか。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/